OL,3,GNEWSANo sign of resolution as Orange
OL,4,AOrder and protesters meet NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith, from the
OL,7,FGarvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,8,F(GRRC) which was protesting against the
OL,9,Fmarch, says he is agreeable to
OL,10,Fmediation following a meeting with the
OL,11,FNI secretary
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland First Minister
OL,14,FMichelle O'Neill, who was among the
OL,15,Fdemonstrators, says she was "incredibly
OL,16,Fproud" to stand with the residents
